        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Beautiful home - very clean in an excellent neighborhood. We had ten people. Could have used more bath towels and facecloths. Also extra towel rods or hooks in master bath for towels. Access to hose to rinse off beach toys! Otherwise, wonderful!",
