        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nIt was one of the best vacation ever for us. We look forward to coming back there real soon. Thanks to the owner, it was the best stay ever. Everything was so clean and fresh. If you are looking for a vacation home, this is the one. Again thanks for everything!! The White's.",
        "title": "2020 Vacation!!! The White's!"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jamie B.",
        "date": "2020-06-28T04:04:28Z",
        "id": "5ef816d122659e603b6fda57",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This house is a bit off the main strip of Rosemary Beach. But we enjoyed the quiet neighborhood. It was about a mile bike ride to Rosemary Beach shopping and dining. The pool and dock were wonderful and our kids enjoyed swimming and jumping in the lake. The house is just a short walk or bike ride to the beach. This is a great section of beach which is more quiet than some of the places on 30A. The house was clean, well-stocked with beach items and kitchen items. We would go back in a heartbeat. Loved the quiet neighborhood and the location to beach, rosemary, shopping and Panama City.",
        "themes": [
